From: delarun <zadli@evileat.org>
Subject: [PATCH] bmc: accept raw host flash images and Host images at the BMC updater

The web UI uploads firmware without a target, which reaches only the
updater at the BMC path, and users have plain BIOS ROM files, not
tarballs with a MANIFEST. Serve BMC and host images from one updater and
wrap an image that carries an Intel flash descriptor into a Host-purpose
image directory (bios.rom + generated MANIFEST).

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [board-specific convenience]
